<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_943_2785.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unnsern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freuendtlichenn</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">willigenn</unclear> dienst <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuovorn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Erbare</unclear>,
<lb n="2"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fürsichtige</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wollweise</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstige</unclear> unnd besonder guote
<lb n="3"/>freuende, E. E. guenstigs schreibenn wegen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnsers</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">buergers</unclear>
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">seligenn</unclear> <persName resp="#ner">Johann <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vonn</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Galln</unclear></persName>, als <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dahß</unclear> sein brueder
<lb n="5"/>E. E. buerger <persName resp="#ner">Jorg Milling</persName> berichtt unnd in erfahrung
<lb n="6"/>solle komen sein, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dahß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brueder</unclear> die schuldt der
<lb n="7"/>nattuer bezaltte, unnd mitt todt abgangenn soll sein,
<lb n="8"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darueber</unclear> gern wissenschafft mocht haben, ob der
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihm</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ettwaß</unclear> in seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leczten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bescheiden</unclear>, od aber seiner
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hindgelahssenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widwen</unclear> seine hab unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gueth</unclear>
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uberlahssenn</unclear>, habenn wyr <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">enpfangen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">verlehsenn</unclear>
<lb n="12"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inhalt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allerseit</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vernohmen</unclear>, da dan E. E. weitter
<lb n="13"/>byttenn thuett, dahß deroselben gruendtlicher unnd
<lb n="14"/>warer bescheidt, wie ehs umb die sach gelegen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mochte</unclear>
<lb n="15"/>durch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> zuogeschribenn werden, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darinn</unclear> wyr
<lb n="16"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> dan der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pilligkeitt</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">willich</unclear> haben finden
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lahssenn</unclear>, Unnd mogen derowegen E. E. freuendtlich
<lb n="18"/>nitt fuerenhalten, dahß fuer eczlichen jahrenn
<lb n="19"/>gemelter <persName resp="#ner">Johan vonn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Sant</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Galln</unclear></persName>, sich alhie bey
<lb n="20"/>und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mytt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnß</unclear> zuo wohnen begeben, und ein
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeittlang</unclear> mitt andern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leuetten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eingesehssen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">danoch</unclear>
<lb n="22"/>aber hatt er durch unnserer und fromer <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leuette</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">huelffe</unclear>
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">haeuß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erbauewett</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wyr</unclear> ihn <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auech</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uff</unclear>
<lb n="24"/>sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vleissigs</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ansuechen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sinttdemall</unclear> er sich redlich
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frumblich</unclear> und woll gehalten, zuo einem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">buerger</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">angenohmen</unclear>, und er eine <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeimbliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitt</unclear> mitt unnß
<lb n="27"/>gewohnett, So hatt ehs sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nuen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">im</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorschlossennen</unclear>
<lb n="28"/><date resp="#ner">70 <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jahre</unclear></date> zuogetragen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dahß</unclear> er mitt schwerer todtlicher
<lb n="29"/>kranckheitt, alß der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wahssersuecht</unclear>, befallen darann
<lb n="30"/>er grosse <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schmerczn</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jamer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ghabtt</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">auech</unclear> eine
<lb n="31"/>lange <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geraeume</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zeitt</unclear> zuo bett gelegen, da er dann
<lb n="32"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">viellmahls</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">guote</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">leuetth</unclear> zuo ihm zuo komen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bytten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lahssen</unclear>,
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">‡</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">reuesent</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erworben</unclear>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_943_2786.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="34"/>auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etliche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">rathsvorwanten</unclear> bey ihm <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gewessen</unclear>, er
<lb n="35"/>aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">keinmahls</unclear> seines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brueders</unclear> mitt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">einem</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wordlein</unclear> gedacht, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wehr</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auch</unclear> seine gelassene
<lb n="37"/>weidtwe auffs vleissigste mitt ernst <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gefraget</unclear>,
<lb n="38"/>ob er auch seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brueder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bescheiden</unclear>,
<lb n="39"/>und wie sein letztes <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abscheiden</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gewessen</unclear>, hatt
<lb n="40"/>sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uns</unclear> diessen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gegenbericht</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">geben</unclear>, daß er
<lb n="41"/>niemands gedacht, sondern <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> seiner schwester
<lb n="42"/>tochter genandt <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ilßebe</unclear></persName> hatt er in seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">letzten</unclear>
<lb n="43"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">der</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weidtwen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">befolen</unclear> und sie gebetten, dieselben
<lb n="44"/>seiner schwester tochter nach seinem absterben
<lb n="45"/>zu sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zunehmen</unclear> und biß sie zun ehren beraten
<lb n="46"/>zum besten zu halten, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">welche</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seiner</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schwester</unclear>
<lb n="47"/>tochter sie <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">itzo</unclear> bey sich hatt, und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sie</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wil</unclear> (so sie
<lb n="48"/>sich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hinfuro</unclear> ehrlich und frumblich, wie bißhero,
<lb n="49"/>verhalten wirdt) gegen sie alß erzeigen, daß
<lb n="50"/>sie ihr zu <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dancken</unclear> haben soll, die <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dan</unclear>
<lb n="51"/>auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">demuetig</unclear> gebetten, daß E. E.
<lb n="52"/>burger ihr <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fatter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dweill</unclear> er ihr so <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">nach</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Johan</unclear>
<lb n="53"/>von der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Halle</unclear></persName> seliger <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vorwandt</unclear>, auch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear> wo
<lb n="54"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mitt</unclear> zu steur und zu hulff komen wolte, damitt
<lb n="55"/>sie ehrlich beraten und zun ehren mochte gebracht
<lb n="56"/>werden, welchs der pilligkeit nicht sehr ungemeeß
<lb n="57"/>daß im aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">von</unclear> seinem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brueder</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">etwas</unclear>, zu
<lb n="58"/>erben, bescheiden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">solte</unclear> sein, ist gar nichts <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ane</unclear>,
<lb n="59"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weißt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ihm</unclear> auch seines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brueders</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">seligers</unclear> hinder-
<lb n="60"/>lassene weidtwe unsere burgerinne, deßalben
<lb n="61"/>nichts den lieb und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtschafft</unclear> zu willen,
<lb n="62"/>welchs wir E. E. Weißheit zu begerter
<lb n="63"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">andwordt</unclear> und gegenbericht <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">freundtlich</unclear> nicht
<lb n="64"/>haben <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">pergen</unclear> wollen, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">darnach</unclear> Ihr den
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_943_2787.jpg" n="3"/>
<lb n="65"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">widerum</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zůberichten</unclear> haben, unnd seindt E. E.
<lb n="66"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">sunsten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">d</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">E</unclear>. in anderm unnd mererm zů dienen
<lb n="67"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wilfartig</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gevlissen</unclear>, den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gaben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unser</unclear>
<lb n="68"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">secret</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">den</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">12</unclear> aprilis anno etc. 71.
<lb n="69"/><orgName role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unnd</unclear> rath
<lb n="70"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dere</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Solzwiedl</unclear></orgName>.
